        <div class="info-row"><span class="key">qatar-rental-yield-guide</span><span class="val">1 clk · 25 imp · pos 7.2</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="key">buying-property-uae-bank-transfer</span><span class="val">0 clk · 23 imp</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="key">abu-dhabi-vs-dubai-investment</span><span class="val">0 clk · 6 imp · pos 20.8</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="key">freehold-vs-leasehold-uae</span><span class="val">0 clk · 5 imp · pos 11.8</span></div>
        <div class="info-row"><span class="key">ajman-property-investment-guide</span><span class="val">0 clk · 5 imp · pos 31.4</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="baseline-box" style="margin-top:16px;background:#ecfdf5;border-color:#86efac;color:#166534;">
      <strong>Insights:</strong> Qatar yield guide already in top-10 — scale this format. Freehold vs leasehold at pos 11.8 is a quick-win candidate once impressions grow. DMCC cluster at pos 40–70 with 10+ combined impressions — expand FAQ block on DMCC guides.
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Analytics — GA4 (G-H725E249H7)</div>
  <div class="pulse-wrap">
    <div class="baseline-box">
      <strong>GA4 Jun 5–10 (launch week).</strong> MCP: <strong>64 sessions</strong>, <strong>71 pageviews</strong>. Peak <strong>21 sessions</strong> on 6 Jun (post-scale deploy). Monitor: organic landing pages, <code>generate_lead</code> on /thanks/, Gulf guide engagement.
    </div>
    <div class="pulse-kpi-row">
      <div class="pulse-kpi">
        <div class="kpi-label">Sessions</div>
        <div class="kpi-val">64</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Property ID 540367626 · Jun 5–10</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pulse-kpi">
        <div class="kpi-label">Users</div>
        <div class="kpi-val">62</div>
        <div class="kpi-sub">Mostly new traffic · launch + crawl bots</div>
      </div>
