        <tr><td>Guides</td><td class="count">522</td><td>Lifestyle GCC + RE/investment · P0 em-dash + QA gates · fix-batch tier B</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Comparisons</td><td class="count">25</td><td>Dubai vs Muscat, Abu Dhabi vs Dubai, freehold vs leasehold…</td></tr>
